[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5520741204","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123121#issuecomment-5520741204","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123121","id":5520741204,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSQ_TVA","user":{"login":"radioactivejackal1414","id":74024384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDI0Mzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74024384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414","html_url":"https://github.com/radioactivejackal1414","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T05:03:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T05:03:42Z","body":"Just tested this for a while and was able to reproduce using the MRP. I wish the MRP was actually minimal and didn't include a bunch of extraneous code and nodes as it makes it difficult to determine what the root cause is.\n\nConnecting via code instead of in-editor GUI fixes it:\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tmouse_entered.connect(_on_mouse_entered)\n\tmouse_exited.connect(_on_mouse_exited)\n```\n\nIf you can specify what causes the signals to not emit when connected in-editor in the specific scene of your project, that would be helpful for narrowing down the cause. I made a minimal scene while I had your project open, connected signals in-editor, and they worked fine for me, so perhaps it's something about that specific scene `number_card.tscn`. I couldn't narrow it down.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5520741204/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5527411692","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123121#issuecomment-5527411692","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123121","id":5527411692,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSXWb7A","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T14:38:38Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T14:38:38Z","body":"In the MRP its because there is a Control node covering it `world_gui`. Changing it to use mouse filter Ignore or Pass allows the Area2D to get mouse entered and exited signals.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5527411692/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5527439855","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123121#issuecomment-5527439855","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123121","id":5527439855,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSXYJ7w","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T14:40:54Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T14:40:54Z","body":"That makes sense and wouldn't be a bug but expected behavior\n\nClosing based on this, if this isn't the actual cause please upload a proper MRP and this can be reopened","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoteng